  "body_text": "图片来自sweet maria's\n基本信息\n国家：埃塞俄比亚 Ethiopia\n产区：南部部族州-西达玛 SNNPR-Sidama-Bensa-Shanta Wene\n庄园/处理厂：邦比 Bombe\n拥有者：Asefa and Mulugeta Dukamo兄弟\n品种：原生种 Heirloom\n海拔：1900 - 2300 米\n烘焙度：浅度 Light Roasted\n风味：桃子，蓝莓，猕猴桃，西梅，话梅尾韵\nPeach, Blue berry, Kiwi, Prune, Preserved plum like finish\n图片来自Roayl coffee\n关于 Bombe\nBombe位于埃塞俄比亚的南部部族州的西达玛区域，Bombe山的山脚下，海拔在周边咖啡种植区域里算是最高的出产地区，它与同区域的Shantawene算是“姐妹”处理站，同属与Daye Bensa公司.\n图片来自sweet marias\nDaye Bensa由Asefa 和 Mulugeta Dukamo兄弟两创建，自己种植，处理并出口咖啡，旗下有15个处理站。\n众号的文章板块有豆子信息\n淘宝店铺和有赞小程序可选购更多豆子～",
  "body_html": "<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content\" id=\"js_content\" style=\"visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; \">\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7S9pMdWCgMTrmavOUWVhgzicwTUVuKBIFMNDfX5zVwGsfC68d9EYPI4ghZbLlMt8CREmoEicBktA0OA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;text-align: center;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;color: rgb(178, 178, 178);\">\n          图片来自sweet maria's\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<strong style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n           基本信息\n          </strong>\n</span>\n<br style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<hr style='white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;border-right-width: 0px;border-style: solid;border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.098);border-bottom-width: 0